// The testing ground: a walled military base on a levelled pad, the live-fire range with its training house in
// the south-west corner, the barracks south of the container stacks, and outside the west wall an obstacle lane.
// Objects come from catalog.ron; positions are millimetres (the object's centre), turn is quarter turns
